# Dither/LZ4 experiments.
#
# 82 MB of BIFs and extracted frames from Jurassic Park, Prometheus and
# Futurama — stills from commercial media, in a public repo, which is exactly
# what F-030 exists to prevent. Ignored wholesale rather than file by file so
# that a `git add -A` cannot reach any of it.
#
# The write-ups are the part worth keeping, and they belong in the knowledge
# repo as a finding rather than here as tracked files. Force-add deliberately
# (`git add -f`) if a script ever needs to be shared.
dither-lz4-experiments/
